title: On The World Stage
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: pres_affairs
view-if: president_party == "SPD" and on_the_world_stage_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; on_the_world_stage_timer += 6;
card-image: img/on_the_world_stage.jpg
max-visits: 6
subtitle: Building ties with foreign powers.

With the Presidency, we can forge relations with governments in Europe and across the world.

- @fr_uk: Build relationships with the French and British governments to move them in Germany's favor.
- @austria: Provide support to the Austrian SDAPÖ.
- @scandi: Encourage a cultural exchange programme with the Scandinavian countries.
- @comintern: Approach the Soviets, to see if a common understanding might be reached.
- @america: Build relations with the United States government.
- @spain: Provide support to the Spanish Republicans in their fight against fascism.
- @return: We do not need international contacts at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@fr_uk
on-arrival: west_relation += 1; reformist_strength += 5; pacifism += 1; moderate_plan_support += 1

We have reached out to the governments of France and Britain. Hopefully they will reduce our reparations burden.

@austria
subtitle: [? if austrian_parliament_seen and not austrian_civil_war_seen: - We will also help the Austrians oppose their dictatorship. ?]
audio: shuffle music/communist/workers_of_vienna_normalized.mp3
on-arrival: left_strength += 5; radicalization += 1; rb_militancy += 0.03; austria_relation += 1; sdapo_strength += 1 if austrian_parliament_seen = 1

Our friends in Austria welcome our support, though the question remains of whether it will be enough.

[? if austrian_parliament_seen and not austrian_civil_war_seen: We are also helping the Austrian Social Democratic Worker's Party build up their resources in preparation for a future struggle, legally and illegally. ?]

@scandi
on-arrival: reformist_strength += 8; wtb_support += 1; moderate_plan_support += 1

The programs of the Nordic socialists involve active government intervention in the economy. With a cultural exchange programme, we can learn from their economic strategies, and how they moved beyond their working-class base to attract a broader set of constituents, all while building relationships with their national governments.

@comintern
on-arrival: resources -= 1; uspd_relation += 5*(1-dissent); spartacist_coalition += 1 if comintern_seen == 0; comintern_seen += 1

We reach out to the USSR. Our talks are productive, though hardly sentimental.

[? if wittorf_soviet_union != 1 and spd_in_government == 0 and dnvp_in_government and volksmai == 1 and comintern_seen >= 1 and wittorf_secret = 1 and ((year = 1929 and month < 7) or year = 1928) and wittorf_soviet_union = 0 : Through our foreign affairs responsibilities, we could, if we wished, reach Moscow through them and see if the Soviets know about the Wittorf Affair, and if they know that we know. ?]

- @wittorf: Yes, let's contact the Soviets about the Wittorf Affair.
- @nothing: We will not attempt to contact the Soviets on the matter.

@wittorf
view-if: wittorf_soviet_union != 1 and spd_in_government == 0 and dnvp_in_government == 1 and volksmai == 1 and comintern_seen >= 1 and wittorf_secret = 1 and ((year = 1929 and month < 7) or year = 1928) and wittorf_soviet_union = 0
on-arrival: wittorf_soviet_union = 1; uspd_relation += 6*(1-dissent)

Of course Stalin and the various leaders of the Comintern know about the Wittorf Affair, but they do not seem to know that we know as well. The Comintern was planning to build a narrative around the affair that absolves Thälmann, but perhaps now they will be less inclined to defend him.

@nothing
view-if: wittorf_soviet_union != 1 and spd_in_government == 0 and dnvp_in_government == 1 and volksmai == 1 and comintern_seen >= 1 and wittorf_secret = 1 and ((year = 1929 and month < 7) or year = 1928) and wittorf_soviet_union = 0

We decide against this course of action.

@america
on-arrival: budget += 1

Our talks with the US government are productive and we succeed in negotiating fresh loans.

@spain
view-if: spanish_civil_war
on-arrival: republic_strength += 0.1; republic_strength += 0.1 if smuggle_seen and foreign_minister_party == "SPD"; republic_strength += 0.05 if rb_force >= 25; reformist_dissent += 4; left_strength += 2; left_dissent -= 3; rb_militancy -= 0.01; rb_strength -= 20

We provide aid to the Republicans in Spain. It is questionable whether even this is enough, but every little bit is appreciated. [? if smuggle_seen : The Foreign Ministry is helping smuggle these volunteers, allowing a greater flow. ?]

@reduce

We do not need the international contacts at the moment.
